    description: ""  # ca61
    fields:  # ca61
      statement: "The properties.py analyzer must handle non-UTF-8 encoded .properties files (Latin-1/ISO-8859-1) without crashing. Hard-coded UTF-8 decoding in _get_node_text() at properties.py:63 causes UnicodeDecodeError on keycloak (byte 0xe9) and jenkins (byte 0xe5)."  # ca61
      root_cause: "_get_node_text() in properties.py uses node.text.decode('utf-8') without fallback. Properties files in Java projects commonly use Latin-1/ISO-8859-1 encoding. The analyzer should use errors='replace' or try multiple encodings."  # ca61
